Direct (host/lcancel_policy.h); here a Direct match uses it only when every player's build offered it, through two more
flags of the build message of net-0004 (0x08: reads the agreement, 0x10: this player has Auto L-cancel on), so both
sides decide from the same exchanged bytes. The press only changes the local controller's input, which then goes to the
other side as any input does. Against Slippi Dolphin or an older build: never. Applied by ../net_sources.sh after net-0010.
